# Design system tokens

All visual styles must use tokens from `src/app/emaro.css`. Do not invent one-off radii, heading sizes, or button heights.

## Radius

| Token | Use |
|---|---|
| `--radius-xs` | Selection highlights |
| `--radius-sm` | Chips, tags, small controls |
| `--radius-md` | Mid cards (reviews, fleet, hero CTA card) |
| `--radius-lg` | Large cards, panels, modals |
| `--radius-shell` | Hero bottom / footer top curves |
| `--radius-pill` | All CTAs and pill controls |

## Type

| Token | Use |
|---|---|
| `--heading-display` | Hero only |
| `--heading-size` | Section titles |
| `--heading-page` | Privacy / 404 |
| `--heading-card` | Card titles |
| `--heading-sub` | Category / subsection titles |
| `--font-weight-heading` | All headings (700) |

## Buttons

Primary charcoal pills: `--btn-height` (48), `--btn-pad-x` (24), `--btn-font` (14), `--btn-weight` (700), `--radius-pill`.

Compact / nav: `--btn-height-sm` (44).

## Shadows

Prefer `--shadow-soft`, `--shadow-card`, `--shadow-elevated`.
